Ta có tần số, tốc độ góc và vận tốc dài được tính là$\text{f}\mathbf{=}\frac{\text{180}}{\text{30}}\mathbf{=}\text{6 Hz}\mathbf{\Rightarrow}\left\{ \begin{array}{r}
\text{ω}\mathbf{=}\text{2πf}\mathbf{=}\text{2π.6}\mathbf{=}\text{12π rad/s.} \\
\text{v}\mathbf{=}\text{rω}\mathbf{=}\text{0,4.12π}\mathbf{=}\text{4,8π m/s.}
\end{array} \right.\$

Ta có$\left\{ \begin{array}{r}
\text{R}\mathbf{=}\text{10 cm}\mathbf{=}\text{0,1 m}\ \ \  \\
\text{T}\mathbf{=}\text{0,2 s}
\end{array} \right.\ \mathbf{\Rightarrow}\text{ω}\mathbf{=}\frac{\text{2π}}{\text{T}}\mathbf{=}\frac{\text{2π}}{\text{0,2}}\mathbf{=}\text{10πrad/s}\mathbf{\Rightarrow}\text{v}\mathbf{=}\text{Rω}\mathbf{=}\text{0,1.10π}\mathbf{=}\text{πm/s.}$

Vì 2 điểm nằm trên cùng bán kính nên có chung tốc độ góc $\text{ω.}$
Khi đó ta có $\left\{ \begin{array}{r}
\text{v}_{\text{A}}\mathbf{=}\text{ω}\text{R}_{\text{A}} \\
\text{v}_{\text{B}}\mathbf{=}\text{ω}\text{R}_{\text{B}}
\end{array} \right.\ \mathbf{\Rightarrow}\frac{\text{v}_{\text{A}}}{\text{v}_{\text{B}}}\mathbf{=}\frac{\text{R}_{\text{A}}}{\text{R}_{\text{B}}}\mathbf{=}\frac{\text{R}_{\text{B}}\mathbf{+}\text{20}}{\text{R}_{\text{B}}}\mathbf{=}\frac{\text{0,6}}{\text{0,2}}\mathbf{\Rightarrow}\text{R}_{\text{B}}\mathbf{=}\text{10 cm}\mathbf{\Rightarrow}\text{ω}\mathbf{=}\frac{\text{v}_{\text{B}}}{\text{R}_{\text{B}}}\mathbf{=}\text{2 rad/s.}$

Đối với kim giờ $\left\{ \begin{array}{r}
\text{T}_{\text{h}}\mathbf{=}\text{12.60.60}\mathbf{=}\text{43200}\ \text{s}\mathbf{\Rightarrow}\text{ω}_{\text{h}}\mathbf{=}\frac{\text{2.π}}{\text{T}_{\text{h}}}\mathbf{=}\text{1,45.1}\text{0}^{\mathbf{-}\text{4}}\ \text{rad/s} \\
\mathbf{\Rightarrow}\text{v}_{\text{h}}\mathbf{=}\text{r.ω}\mathbf{=}\text{2,5.1}\text{0}^{\mathbf{-}\text{2}}\text{.1,45.1}\text{0}^{\mathbf{-}\text{4}}\mathbf{=}\text{3,4.1}\text{0}^{\mathbf{-}\text{6}}\ \text{m/s}
\end{array} \right.\$
Đối với kim phút $\left\{ \begin{array}{r}
\text{T}_{\text{ph}}\mathbf{=}\text{60.60}\mathbf{=}\text{3600}\ \text{s}\mathbf{\Rightarrow}\text{ω}_{\text{ph}}\mathbf{=}\frac{\text{2.π}}{\text{T}_{\text{ph}}}\mathbf{=}\text{1,74.1}\text{0}^{\mathbf{-}\text{3}}\ \text{rad/s} \\
\mathbf{\Rightarrow}\text{v}_{\text{ph}}\mathbf{=}\text{r.ω}\mathbf{=}\text{3.1}\text{0}^{\mathbf{-}\text{2}}\text{.1,45.1}\text{0}^{\text{4}}\mathbf{=}\text{5,2.1}\text{0}^{\mathbf{-}\text{5}}\ \text{m/s}
\end{array} \right.\$
$\Rightarrow\frac{\text{ω}_{\text{h}}}{\text{ω}_{\text{ph}}}=\frac{\text{1,45.1}\text{0}^{-\text{4}}}{\text{1,74.1}\text{0}^{-\text{3}}}\Rightarrow\text{ω}_{\text{ph}}=\text{12}\text{ω}_{\text{h}}$

